					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "REPLACE NAN\n\nThe Replace NaN node replaces all NaN(not a number) values with a given value.\nThis can be useful when you have a patch that might reach NaN for some reason and you don’t want your math to go all weird and crazy on you."
					}
				},
